   "object": "library",
   "quote": "In 1832 , the library was established by bookbinder Gligorije Vozarović in his bookstore",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/National_Library_of_Serbia#1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Dimitrije Davidović sent a letter on the organization of the library to Miloš Obrenović.",
   "chunk": 1,
   "date_text": "28 February 1832",
   "date": "1832-02-28",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "other",
   "object": "library",
   "quote": "On 28 February 1832 , Dimitrije Davidović sent a letter on the organization of the library to Miloš Obrenović",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/National_Library_of_Serbia#1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Prince Miloš ordered that one copy of each printed book be made available to the library.",
   "chunk": 1,
   "date_text": "In November of the same year",
   "date": "1832-11",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "other",
   "object": "library",
