   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/National_Library_of_Serbia#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Library became the central state Library and obtained the right to acquire an obligatory copy from all over the Kingdom of Yugoslavia.",
   "chunk": 2,
