   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/National_Library_of_Serbia#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Library building was bombed and gutted by fire from the 6th to 9th April 1941 at the start of World War II.",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "6th to 9th April 1941",
   "date": "1941-04-06",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Library building",
   "quote": "bombed and gutted by fire sixteen years later from the 6th to 9th April 1941 at the start of World War II",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [
    "quote_not_in_chunk"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/National_Library_of_Serbia#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "The bombing by Nazi Germany's Luftwaffe completely destroyed the Library building including a priceless book collection.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": null,
   "date": null,
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
   "subject": "self",
   "object": "Library building",
   "quote": "The bombing by Nazi Germanys Luftwaffe of a city officially proclaimed open , completely destroyed the Library building",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [
    "name_not_in_page:Germany's"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/National_Library_of_Serbia#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "After the liberation of Belgrade, there was a period of intensive reconstruction of the lost collections and rapid development of the Library.",
   "chunk": 6,
   "date_text": "1944",
   "date": "1944",
   "approximate": false,
   "track": "other",
   "phase": "point",
   "kind": "occurrence",
